<h2>No Way Home</h2>
<p>
Stranded in a strange galaxy, you must fight for survival using only your wits, your ship, and your party planning robot companion. Explore the universe, befriend bizarre aliens, and blast through hordes of monsters as you endeavor to find a way home.<br>
A twin-stick shooter set in an expansive, procedurally generated universe, where players explore strange worlds, battle bizarre creatures, and gather resources to find a way back home.
</p>
<p>
<strong>Developer: SMG Studio</strong><br>
<strong>Release Date: </strong>10/01/2020<br>
<strong>Platforms: </strong>Apple Arcade (Now no longer live)<br>
</p>